/*!
    \page qwemodules.html
    \title All Qt WebEngine and Qt Pdf modules
    \brief A list of all modules in Qt WebEngine and Qt Pdf.

    \ingroup classlists

    \section1 Extension Modules

    All modules here are extensions to Qt, with separate platform and compiler support requirements, but
    released together due a close reliance on a shared Chromium third-party module.

    \grid
        \griditem {qtpdf-index.html}{Qt PDF} {
            Classes and functions for rendering PDF documents on desktop platforms.
        }
        \griditem {qtwebengine-index.html}{Qt WebEngine} {
            Classes and functions for embedding web content in applications using the
            Chromium browser project.
        }
    \endgrid

*/
